# S-044: allow_clipping inputs receive the unclamped copy; others receive the clamped buffer. NaN stays NaN in the
# unclamped copy; the unclamped copy is only produced for mixes that have inputs.
aopen main 48000 FLOAT_PLANAR STEREO
aconnect a 1 0 - - - 0
aconnect b 2 0 - - - 1
aconnect a 3 1 48000 FLOAT_PLANAR STEREO 1
afeed 0 0 0 1 4 set
afeed 0 0 1 1 nan set
afeed 0 0 2 1 -0.5 set
afeed 1 1 0 1 -9 set
anewts delta 0
atick
# callback order within a mix is reverse registration order (b2 before a1)
adump
aclose
